{"parents": [], "prev": {"link": "../../auth_types/", "title": "Auth Types"}, "next": {"link": "../../encryption/encrypt/", "title": "Encrypt"}, "title": "Abstract", "meta": {}, "body": "<section id=\"module-store.abstract\">\n<span id=\"abstract\"></span><h1>Abstract<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-store.abstract\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<section id=\"attributes\">\n<h2>Attributes<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#attributes\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrapper autosummary longtable docutils container\">\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#store.abstract.T\" title=\"store.abstract.T\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">T</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"classes\">\n<h2>Classes<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#classes\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrapper autosummary longtable docutils container\">\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#store.abstract.AbstractDataStore\" title=\"store.abstract.AbstractDataStore\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AbstractDataStore</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Abstract base class for data stores.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#store.abstract.StateStore\" title=\"store.abstract.StateStore\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">StateStore</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Abstract store for persistent session data.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#store.abstract.TransactionStore\" title=\"store.abstract.TransactionStore\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">TransactionStore</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Abstract store for temporary transaction data during auth flows.</p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"module-contents\">\n<h2>Module Contents<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-contents\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"store.abstract.AbstractDataStore\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">store.abstract.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">AbstractDataStore</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">options</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#store.abstract.AbstractDataStore\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Generic</span></code>[<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#store.abstract.T\" title=\"store.abstract.T\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">T</span></code></a>], <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/abc.html#abc.ABC\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">abc.ABC</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Abstract base class for data stores.\nProvides common functionality for different store implementations.</p>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"store.abstract.AbstractDataStore.decrypt\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">decrypt</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">identifier</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">encrypted_data</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">T</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#store.abstract.AbstractDataStore.decrypt\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Decrypt data after retrieval.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>identifier</strong> \u2013 Unique key used as part of encryption salt</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>encrypted_data</strong> \u2013 Encrypted data to decrypt</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>Decrypted data</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"store.abstract.AbstractDataStore.delete\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">abstract</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">delete</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">identifier</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">options</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#store.abstract.AbstractDataStore.delete\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Async<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p></p></dd>\n</dl>\n<p>Delete data by identifier.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>identifier</strong> \u2013 Unique key for the stored data</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>options</strong> \u2013 Additional operation-specific options</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"store.abstract.AbstractDataStore.encrypt\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">encrypt</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">identifier</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">state_data</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">T</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#store.abstract.AbstractDataStore.encrypt\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Encrypt data before storing.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>identifier</strong> \u2013 Unique key used as part of encryption salt</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>state_data</strong> \u2013 Data to encrypt</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>Encrypted string representation of the data</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"store.abstract.AbstractDataStore.get\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">abstract</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">get</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">identifier</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">options</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#store.abstract.AbstractDataStore.get\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Async<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p></p></dd>\n</dl>\n<p>Retrieve data by identifier.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>identifier</strong> \u2013 Unique key for the stored data</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>options</strong> \u2013 Additional operation-specific options</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>The stored data or None if not found</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"store.abstract.AbstractDataStore.set\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">abstract</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">set</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">identifier</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">state</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">T</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">remove_if_expires</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></a></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">False</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">options</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#store.abstract.AbstractDataStore.set\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Async<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p></p></dd>\n</dl>\n<p>Store data with the given identifier.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>identifier</strong> \u2013 Unique key for the stored data</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>state</strong> \u2013 Data to store</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>remove_if_expires</strong> \u2013 Whether to auto-remove expired data</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>options</strong> \u2013 Additional operation-specific options</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"store.abstract.StateStore\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">store.abstract.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">StateStore</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">options</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#store.abstract.StateStore\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#store.abstract.AbstractDataStore\" title=\"store.abstract.AbstractDataStore\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AbstractDataStore</span></code></a>[<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></code></a>[<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code></a>, <code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Any</span></code>]]</p>\n<p>Abstract store for persistent session data.\nExtends AbstractDataStore with logout token functionality.</p>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"store.abstract.StateStore.delete_by_logout_token\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">abstract</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">delete_by_logout_token</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">claims</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">options</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#store.abstract.StateStore.delete_by_logout_token\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Async<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p></p></dd>\n</dl>\n<p>Delete sessions based on logout token claims.</p>\n<p>Per the OIDC Back-Channel Logout spec, either <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">sid</span></code> or <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">sub</span></code>\n(or both) will be present. Implementations should match on\nwhichever claim is present (OR logic), not require both (AND).</p>\n<p>When <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">iss</span></code> is present in claims (always included by the SDK),\nimplementations should validate that the token\u2019s issuer matches\nthe session\u2019s stored domain before deleting. This prevents\ncross-domain session deletion in MCD deployments.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>claims</strong> \u2013 <p>Claims from the logout token. Keys:\n- <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">sub</span></code>: Subject identifier of the user\n- <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">sid</span></code>: Session identifier\n- <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">iss</span></code>: Token issuer (always included; compare against</p>\n<blockquote>\n<div><p>session domain before deletion)</p>\n</div></blockquote>\n</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>options</strong> \u2013 Additional operation-specific options</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<div class=\"admonition note\">\n<p class=\"admonition-title\">Note</p>\n<p>Default implementation raises NotImplementedError.\nConcrete implementations should override this method.</p>\n</div>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"store.abstract.TransactionStore\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">store.abstract.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">TransactionStore</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">options</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#store.abstract.TransactionStore\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#store.abstract.AbstractDataStore\" title=\"store.abstract.AbstractDataStore\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AbstractDataStore</span></code></a>[<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></code></a>[<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code></a>, <code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Any</span></code>]]</p>\n<p>Abstract store for temporary transaction data during auth flows.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"store.abstract.T\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">store.abstract.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">T</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#store.abstract.T\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["reference/encryption/encrypt/index", "Encrypt", "N", "next"], ["reference/auth_types/index", "Auth Types", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "reference/store/abstract/index.rst.txt", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">Abstract</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#attributes\">Attributes</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#classes\">Classes</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#module-contents\">Module Contents</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#store.abstract.AbstractDataStore\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AbstractDataStore</span></code></a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#store.abstract.AbstractDataStore.decrypt\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AbstractDataStore.decrypt()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#store.abstract.AbstractDataStore.delete\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AbstractDataStore.delete()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#store.abstract.AbstractDataStore.encrypt\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AbstractDataStore.encrypt()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#store.abstract.AbstractDataStore.get\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AbstractDataStore.get()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#store.abstract.AbstractDataStore.set\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AbstractDataStore.set()</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#store.abstract.StateStore\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">StateStore</span></code></a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#store.abstract.StateStore.delete_by_logout_token\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">StateStore.delete_by_logout_token()</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#store.abstract.TransactionStore\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">TransactionStore</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#store.abstract.T\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">T</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "reference/store/abstract/index", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.ht